class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and it must satisfy <span class=\"math display\" data-tex=\"\\[\\mathbb{E}_{P}\\bigl[\\|f'(\\bar{x})\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}^2\\bigr]\n\\leq\\varepsilon^2.\\]\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D53C TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"OPEN\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2225\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em; margin-left: 0.053em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.314em; margin-bottom: -0.544em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAF\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2225\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.247em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.343em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c70\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D700 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\">∥</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\">∥</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">op</mi></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>ε</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></p>\n", "theorems": [], "comparisonHtml": null, "source": "import LongTails.Template\nimport Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.FDeriv.Basic\n\nopen MeasureTheory\n\nnamespace LongTails.Setups.SmoothNonconvexNonEuclidean\n\nopen OracleTemplate\n\nstructure Params where\n  E : Type u\n  [normedE : NormedAddCommGroup E]\n  [linearE : NormedSpace ℝ E]\n  [completeE : CompleteSpace E]\n  [measurableE : MeasurableSpace E]\n  L : ℝ\n  Δ : ℝ\n  ε : ℝ\n  x0 : E\n\nattribute [instance] Params.normedE Params.linearE Params.completeE Params.measurableE\n\nabbrev spec : Setup where\n  Params := Params\n  Public := Params\n  Instance p := p.E → ℝ\n  Query p := p.E\n  Reply p := p.E →L[ℝ] ℝ\n  Output p := p.E\n  publicInput p := p\n  valid q := 0 < q.L ∧ 0 ≤ q.Δ ∧ 0 < q.ε\n  admissible q f oracle :=\n    (∀ k seed x, HasFDerivAt f (oracle.answer k (0, x) seed) x) ∧\n    (∀ x, HasFDerivAt f (fderiv ℝ f x) x) ∧\n    (∀ x y, ‖fderiv ℝ f x - fderiv ℝ f y‖ ≤ q.L * ‖x - y‖) ∧\n    (∃ lower : ℝ, (∀ x, lower ≤ f x) ∧ f q.x0 - lower ≤ q.Δ)\n  successful q f output P :=\n    Measurable output ∧\n    Integrable (fun ω => ‖fderiv ℝ f (output ω)‖^2) (P : Measure _) ∧\n    (∫ ω, ‖fderiv ℝ f (output ω)‖^2 ∂(P : Measure _)) ≤ q.ε^2\n\nend LongTails.Setups.SmoothNonconvexNonEuclidean\n", "url": "setups/SmoothNonconvexNonEuclidean/"}